    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n376" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ac-clāro</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adc.</span></b> ), āvi, ātum,
